on":false,"section-blog-ads":[]},"is_capital_matters_archive":false,"specific_term_link":"<a href=\\"https:\\/\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/politics-policy\\/\\" class=\\"underline\\">Politics &amp; Policy<\\/a>"},"primary_section":{"id":615,"count":86346,"description":"","link":"https:\\/\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/article\\/","name":"Article","slug":"article","taxonomy":"section","parent":0,"meta":{"blog-section":false,"section-blog-ads":[]},"is_capital_matters_archive":false},"primary_tag":[],"subtitle":"Another public-transit attack by a deranged recidivist, this time in Chicago","is_capital_matters":false,"is_wfb_100":false,"is_magazine_article":false,"is_premium_content":true,"table_of_contents":null,"truncated_content":"<p><span class=\\"drop\\">A<\\/span><span class=\\"small_caps\\">nother <\\/span>innocent, beautiful young woman was viciously attacked by a career criminal on public transportation, this time in Chicago. Twenty-six-year-old Bethany MaGee was set on fire and critically injured by a mentally ill menace who reportedly had \\u2014 prepare to be appalled \\u2014 72 prior arrests. What\\u2019s next?<\\/p>\\n<p>The attack comes just three months after the horror of Ukrainian refugee Iryna Zarutska\\u2019s brutal murder on North Carolina public transit, allegedly by Decarlos Brown Jr., who had been arrested and institutionalized <a href=\\"https:\\/\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/corner\\/hes-the-killer-not-the-victim\\/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">more than a dozen times<\\/a>. The details of the Chicago attack are tragically similar: On November 17, MaGee was quietly reading <a href=\\"https:\\/\\/cwbchicago.com\\/2025\\/11\\/prosecutor-warned-judge-before-release-of-man-now-accused-in-cta-fire-attack-transcripts.html\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\"><\\/a> ...<\\/p>\\n","right_rail_widget":{"widget_type":"more-from-author","slideshow_widget_title":"Latest Photos","slideshow_widget_post":null,"slideshow_widget_post_title":"","slide