-dc.jpg?resize=789%2C460&amp;ssl=1 789w, https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/national-guard-dc.jpg?resize=258%2C149&amp;ssl=1 258w, https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/national-guard-dc.jpg?resize=459%2C268&amp;ssl=1 459w, https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/national-guard-dc.jpg?resize=710%2C414&amp;ssl=1 710w, https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/national-guard-dc.jpg?resize=50%2C29&amp;ssl=1 50w, https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/national-guard-dc.jpg?w=1054&amp;ssl=1 1054w\\" \\/>","flex-media-thumbnail":"<img width=\\"258\\" height=\\"149\\" src=\\"https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/national-guard-dc.jpg?resize=258%2C149&amp;ssl=1\\" class=\\"attachment-flex-media-thumbnail size-flex-media-thumbnail\\" alt=\\"National Guard members walk near a cordoned-off area after two National Guard members were reportedly shot near the White House\\" loading=\\"lazy\\" sizes=\\"auto, (max-width: 258px) 100vw, 258px\\" decoding=\\"async\\" srcset=\\"https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/national-guard-dc.jpg?resize=140%2C80&amp;ssl=1 140w, https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/national-guard-dc.jpg?resize=258%2C149&amp;ssl=1 258w, https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/national-guard-dc.jpg?resize=50%2C29&amp;ssl=1 50w, https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/national-guard-dc.jpg?zoom=2&amp;resize=258%2C149&amp;ssl=1 516w\\" \\/>","medium_large":"<img width=\\"527\\" height=\\"307\\" src=\\"https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/national-guard-dc.jpg?fit=527%2C307&amp