https:\\/\\/apnews.com\\/article\\/venezuela-maduro-cartel-soles-us-drugs-terrorist-f778922c04b4f514092bd29b91e77358\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">officially designated<\\/a> Venezuela's Cartel de los Soles a foreign terrorist organization. And because the United States believes that Venezuelan caudillo Nicol\\u00e1s Maduro sits at the head of that drug-trafficking outfit, Washington now recognizes his regime as a narco-terrorist organization.<\\/p>\\n<p>The president has made no secret of his desire to see Maduro removed from power. His administration has reportedly authorized <a href=\\"https:\\/\\/www.nytimes.com\\/2025\\/11\\/18\\/us\\/politics\\/trump-covert-action-venezuela.html\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">covert U.S. intelligence operations<\\/a> aimed at destabilizing Maduro\\u2019s authority in Caracas. Many observers believe that military action against the Venezuelan government is imminent. But the Trump administration may be surprised by the public\\u2019s equally shocked response to such <a href=\\"https:\\/\\/www.cbsnews.com\\/news\\/poll-venezuela-u-s-military-action-trump\\/\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\"><\\/a> ...<\\/p>\\n","right_rail_widget":{"widget_type":"more-from-author","slideshow_widget_title":"Latest Photos","slideshow_widget_post":null,"slideshow_widget_post_title":"","slideshow_widget_categories_exclude":[6068]},"amp_enabled":true,"__type__":"post"},"request":{"type":"singular","object_type":"post","is_premium_content":true,"is_magazine_article":false,"is_metered":true},"schema_ld":"{\\n    \\"@context\\": \\"http:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/schema.org\\",\\n    \\"@type\\": \\"NewsArticle\\",\\n    \\"headline\\": \\"The Countdown to Conflict with Venezuela Looks Nothing Like the Run-Up to the Iran Strikes\\",\\n    \\"url\\": \\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/www.nationalreview.com\\\\\\/2025\\\\\\/11\\\\\\/the-countdown-to-conflict-with-venezuela-looks-nothing-like-the-run-up-to-the-iran-strikes\\\\\\/\\",\\n    \\"thumbna