 15, 2024.\\" loading=\\"lazy\\" sizes=\\"auto, (max-width: 527px) 100vw, 527px\\" decoding=\\"async\\" srcset=\\"https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/greta-thunberg-1.jpg?resize=300%2C175&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/greta-thunberg-1.jpg?resize=527%2C307&amp;ssl=1 527w, https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/greta-thunberg-1.jpg?resize=258%2C149&amp;ssl=1 258w, https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/greta-thunberg-1.jpg?resize=459%2C268&amp;ssl=1 459w, https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/greta-thunberg-1.jpg?resize=50%2C29&amp;ssl=1 50w, https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/greta-thunberg-1.jpg?w=1054&amp;ssl=1 1054w\\" \\/>","loop-thumbnail":"<img width=\\"252\\" height=\\"141\\" src=\\"https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/greta-thunberg-1.jpg?resize=252%2C141&amp;ssl=1\\" class=\\"attachment-loop-thumbnail size-loop-thumbnail\\" alt=\\"Greta Thunberg takes part in a protest in front of the United Nations office building in Yerevan, Armenia, November 15, 2024.\\" loading=\\"lazy\\" sizes=\\"auto, (max-width: 252px) 100vw, 252px\\" decoding=\\"async\\" srcset=\\"https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/greta-thunberg-1.jpg?resize=252%2C141&amp;ssl=1 252w, https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/greta-thunberg-1.jpg?resize=160%2C90&amp;ssl=1 160w, https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/greta-thunberg-1.jpg?resize=50%2C29&amp;ssl=1 50w, https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/greta-thunberg-1.jpg?zoom=2&amp;resize=252%2C141&amp;ssl=1 504w\\" \\/>"},"source_url":"https:\\/\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/11\\/greta-thunberg-1.jpg"},"primary_category":{"id":5878,"count":2881,"description":"","link":"https:\\/\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/woke-culture\\/","name":"Woke Culture","slug":"woke-culture","taxonomy":"category","parent":1290,"meta":{"blog-section":false,"section-blog-ads":[]},"is_capital_matters_archive":false,"specific_term_link":"<a href=\\"https:\\/\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/woke-culture\\/\\" class=\\"underline\\">Woke Culture<\\/a>"},"is_capital_matters":false,"is_wfb_100":false,"is_magazine_article":false,"is_premium_content":true},{"id":1897478,"date":"2025-11-26T14:34:14","type":"blog-post","link":"https:\\/\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/corner\\/no-the-poverty-threshold-is-not-140000-good-grief\\/","title":{"rendered":"No, the Poverty Threshold Is Not $140,000 (Good Grief)"},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>A much-discussed essay making that claim is wrong in at least six ways.<\\/p>\\n","protected":false},"comment_status":"open","meta":{"hide-more-from-author":true,"disable-player":false,"disable-wfb-100-badge":false,"disable-wfb-100-archive-widget":false,"disable-wfb-100-legacy-widget":false,"hide_top_stories":false,"headline_variations":[],"coral_asset_id":"","_cr_original_post":"","_cr_replace_post_id":"","_cr_replacing_post_id":"","_links_to":"","_links_to_type":0,"hide-blog-landing-image":false,"footnotes":""},"share_buttons":{"facebook":{"title":"Share on Facebook","href":"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/sharer\\/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nationalreview.com%2Fcorner%2Fno-the-poverty-threshold-is-not-140000-good-grief%2F"},"twitter":{"title":"Share on Twitter","href":"https:\\/\\/twitter.com\\/intent\\/tweet?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nationalreview.com%2Fcorner%2Fno-the-poverty-threshold-is-not-140000-good-grief%2F&text=No%2C%20the%20Poverty%20Threshold%20Is%20Not%20%24140%2C000%20%28Good%20Grief%29"},"flipboard":{"title":"Share on Flipboard","href":"https:\\/\\/share.flipboard