ing Jolt","title_mobile":"Stay Ahead with The Morning Jolt","title_font_size":"1.9rem","title_line_height":"1.8rem","title_color":"#000000","title_color_header":"#000000","text":"Start your mornings with expert political insights from NR\\u2019s Jim Geraghty.","text_mobile":"Dive into the day\\u2019s top stories with Jim Geraghty\\u2019s expert analysis.","text_font_size":"1.05rem","text_line_height":"1.45rem","text_color":"#000000","text_color_header":"#000000","background_color":"#ffffff","background_color_header":"#ffffff","button_color":"#b37c29","button_border_color":"#ffffff","button_text_color":"#ffffff","button_color_header":"#b37c29","button_text_color_header":"#b37c29","border_width":"1px","border_color":"#d3d3d3","image":{"caption":"","credit":"","images":{"large":"<img width=\\"253\\" height=\\"202\\" src=\\"https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/08\\/coffee_brass_icon-NLblock.png?fit=253%2C202&amp;ssl=1\\" class=\\"attachment-large size-large\\" alt=\\"\\" loading=\\"lazy\\" sizes=\\"auto, (max-width: 253px) 100vw, 253px\\" decoding=\\"async\\" srcset=\\"https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/08\\/coffee_brass_icon-NLblock.png?w=253&amp;ssl=1 253w, https:\\/\\/i0.wp.com\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/08\\/coffee_brass_icon-NLblock.png?resize=50%2C40&amp;ssl=1 50w\\" \\/>"},"source_url":"https:\\/\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/08\\/coffee_brass_icon-NLblock.png"},"image_max_width_desktop":"175px","image_max_width_mobile":"150px","image_padding_desktop":"15px","image_padding_mobile":"10px"},"next_up":{"id":1903085,"link":"https:\\/\\/www.nationalreview.com\\/2025\\/12\\/2025-a-year-in-reading\\/","title":{"rendered":"2025: A Year in Reading"},"cta_label":"Next Article"},"nrplus_cta":{"enabled":false,"title":"Something to Consider","description":"<p>If you enjoyed this article, we have a proposition for you:\\u00a0<a href=\\"