ution.", "The effectiveness of the Trump administration's approach is debated, with some suggesting alternative strategies might yield better outcomes for the Venezuelan people.", "The debate reflects broader questions about the role of international intervention in national politics and the best ways to support democratic transitions."]	{"text": "As the Trump administration escalates pressure on Venezuela, experts warn that Nicolás Maduro’s downfall could open the door to a successor \\"even worse\\" than the dictator himself and unleash a landscape dominated by drug cartels, guerrilla factions and armed warlords who have embedded themselves across Venezuela for decades. Venezuela today is less a centralized dictatorship and more a patchwork of criminal territories controlled by cartels, Colombian insurgents and regime-aligned militias.", "articleId": "c3b2942f-9354-4ce0-b6b7-331734d891aa", "articleUrl": "https://www.foxnews.com/world/maduros-heirs-human-rights-violators-corrupt-enforcers-ruthless-loyalists", "outletName": "Fox News", "articleTitle": "Maduro’s heirs: human rights violators, corrupt enforcers and ruthless loyalists"}
