rdline stance against the Maduro government."]	{"text": "The article discusses the Trump administration's actions against the Cartel de los Soles, including designating it as a foreign terrorist organization. It mentions the Cartel's involvement in drug trafficking and its impact on terrorist violence in the hemisphere, as well as trafficking drugs into the United States and Europe. This information, particularly the statement from Secretary of State Marco Rubio about the Cartel's responsibility for terrorist violence and drug trafficking, supports the stance that the designation is justified.", "articleId": "c417994d-b9c9-4934-bd53-4032a248648b", "articleUrl": "https://www.foxnews.com/world/airlines-pull-venezuela-flights-safety-warning-trump-ratchets-pressure-maduro", "outletName": "Fox News", "articleTitle": "Airlines pull Venezuela flights amid safety warning, as Trump ratchets up pressure on Maduro"}
