e, as a step toward resolving the conflict.", "The debate reflects broader geopolitical tensions and the complexities of international diplomacy in addressing regional conflicts.", "The effectiveness of sanctions as a strategy is viewed differently across the international community, with varying levels of confidence in their ability to support Ukraine against Russian aggression."]	{"text": "\\"To secure the best outcome for Ukraine and Europe, we have to stay the course but pick up pace,\\" Kallas said. \\"This means more sanctions to deprive Russia of the means to fight and more military and financial support to Ukraine,\\" she added.", "articleId": "76420f4b-7653-4d14-974e-aae8e9bfbaeb", "articleUrl": "https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-updates-eu-calls-for-more-russia-sanctions/live-74899120?maca=en-rss-en-eu-2092-rdf", "outletName": "Deutsche Welle", "articleTitle": "Ukraine updates: EU calls for more Russia sanctions"}
