g while states and even some cities surge ahead with expansive new laws. Companies now face a patchwork of rules that make strong internal governance more important than ever.", "articleId": "1", "outletName": "Wall Street Journal", "articleTitle": "AI Regulation Shifts as States Surge Ahead in 2025"}
