 community.", "There is uncertainty surrounding the actual impact of the exclusion, with some questioning the effectiveness of such measures in prompting change in domestic policies of excluded countries."]	{"text": "United States President Donald Trump has announced he will block South Africa from attending next year’s G20 summit, as relations between the two nations continue to sour. The Group of 20 comprises 19 leading economies plus the European Union – and, now, the African Union. Countries within the group meet throughout the year, but an annual summit is also held, hosted by the country holding the presidency of the group.", "articleId": "89d1f380-b7ab-418d-8f30-31559dcba98b", "articleUrl": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2025/11/27/can-trump-ban-south-africa-from-2026-g20-summit-as-he-says-he-will?traffic_source=rss", "outletName": "Al Jazeera English", "articleTitle": "Can Trump ban South Africa from 2026 G20 summit, as he says he will?"}
